845
01:13:10,120 --> 01:13:14,120
LexisNexis is not anyway related to camera systems at all.

846
01:13:14,120 --> 01:13:18,120
So LexisNexis is the system that supports the background check process.

847
01:13:18,120 --> 01:13:22,120
So for example, certain employees that we hire, any police officer we hire as an example,

848
01:13:22,120 --> 01:13:25,120
anybody like me, when I got hired I had to go through a background check.

849
01:13:25,120 --> 01:13:31,120
Sometimes if you need to get an alcohol license or things, there are certain things like that that require a background check

850
01:13:31,120 --> 01:13:33,120
and the police department is who conducts those.

851
01:13:33,120 --> 01:13:37,120
And so LexisNexis is the system that manages the background check process.

852
01:13:37,120 --> 01:13:40,120
Bidded in no way is related to camera systems.

853
01:13:40,120 --> 01:13:44,120
The $36,000 is the annual payment and so that's just paying for that,

854
01:13:44,120 --> 01:13:48,120
the annual contract for that system that manages the background check process.

855
01:13:48,120 --> 01:13:52,120
Are they not related to criminal investigations, LexisNexis?

856
01:13:52,120 --> 01:13:57,120
Well, if they need to get in and do any kind of background check kind of things, that's what really a background check is.

857
01:13:57,120 --> 01:14:02,120
So for example, when we did an employment background check on me, I was looking to see did I ever commit a felony,

858
01:14:02,120 --> 01:14:04,120
did I have other things like that in my background.

859
01:14:04,120 --> 01:14:10,120
