1466
02:04:11,120 --> 02:04:12,120
It's our recommendation.

1467
02:04:12,120 --> 02:04:16,120
It's actually better to allow them to continue to operate that specific building for that purpose.

1468
02:04:16,120 --> 02:04:21,120
They already have employees that are that are dedicated that to that function.

1469
02:04:21,120 --> 02:04:22,120
