1933
02:43:55,120 --> 02:44:01,120
My name is John Anderson, a resident of Huntsville, and I am delivering part two of our presentation.

1934
02:44:02,120 --> 02:44:10,120
According to city parcel maps, the venue property sits a mere 320 feet from our doorstep.

1935
02:44:10,120 --> 02:44:26,120
Without any physical barrier or structural buffer zone between the entertainment district and our neighborhood, loud concert volumes and vibrations travel freely, striking our neighboring homes at full force.

1936
02:44:26,120 --> 02:44:50,120
To illustrate how broken this system is, six weeks ago on Thursday, September 24th, 2026, at approximately 9.45 p.m., we were forced to call the non-emergency line due to excessive noise transferring into our home from music coming from the furniture factory.

